    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Procedural Music Generator</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851240/extras/8250b55fe6828e3d9c96ab9771739358.poster.avif?t=1755083841\" width=508 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851240/extras/8250b55fe6828e3d9c96ab9771739358.webm?t=1755083841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851240/extras/8250b55fe6828e3d9c96ab9771739358.mp4?t=1755083841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place various musical entities to create sounds and light. The game starts out simple with few objects to place...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2800</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Complex Systems</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851240/extras/db6f7c0b9f9cc23becbd40243756d5f8.poster.avif?t=1755083841\" width=508 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851240/extras/db6f7c0b9f9cc23becbd40243756d5f8.webm?t=1755083841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851240/extras/db6f7c0b9f9cc23becbd40243756d5f8.mp4?t=1755083841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >... over time you unlock more objects and the levels become more complex. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2800</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Playful, Weird and Experimental</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851240/extras/7ab437f4e190b44090d7680d09124781.poster.avif?t=1755083841\" width=508 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851240/extras/7ab437f4e190b44090d7680d09124781.webm?t=1755083841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851240/extras/7ab437f4e190b44090d7680d09124781.mp4?t=1755083841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a break from the puzzle based mode and explore the main hub.\u2800</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gameplay here is more open ended and experimental.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2800</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pig</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851240/extras/d5be249d73c277935f43b0012e67dfd4.poster.avif?t=1755083841\" width=508 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851240/extras/d5be249d73c277935f43b0012e67dfd4.webm?t=1755083841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851240/extras/d5be249d73c277935f43b0012e67dfd4.mp4?t=1755083841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything you saw above takes place inside the pig.\u2800</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the mind of a dissonant Pig and explore its different realms and domains.\u2800</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Divide molecules, command cellular entities, rearrange and light up neurologic pathways, combine harmonic and gurgling sound cells, squish or drench the warbling ligaments,... These are some of the jobs you'll come across in KLOPPYSSIMO to help you understand the inner workings of the ever elusive Pig.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851240/extras/935ad8546d94f0458b68f388c6a9a64f.poster.avif?t=1755083841\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851240/extras/935ad8546d94f0458b68f388c6a9a64f.webm?t=1755083841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851240/extras/935ad8546d94f0458b68f388c6a9a64f.mp4?t=1755083841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Procedural Music Generator</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851240/extras/8250b55fe6828e3d9c96ab9771739358.poster.avif?t=1755083841\" width=508 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851240/extras/8250b55fe6828e3d9c96ab9771739358.webm?t=1755083841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851240/extras/8250b55fe6828e3d9c96ab9771739358.mp4?t=1755083841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place various musical entities to create sounds and light. The game starts out simple with few objects to place...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2800</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Complex Systems</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851240/extras/db6f7c0b9f9cc23becbd40243756d5f8.poster.avif?t=1755083841\" width=508 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851240/extras/db6f7c0b9f9cc23becbd40243756d5f8.webm?t=1755083841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851240/extras/db6f7c0b9f9cc23becbd40243756d5f8.mp4?t=1755083841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >... over time you unlock more objects and the levels become more complex. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2800</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Playful, Weird and Experimental</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851240/extras/7ab437f4e190b44090d7680d09124781.poster.avif?t=1755083841\" width=508 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851240/extras/7ab437f4e190b44090d7680d09124781.webm?t=1755083841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851240/extras/7ab437f4e190b44090d7680d09124781.mp4?t=1755083841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a break from the puzzle based mode and explore the main hub.\u2800</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gameplay here is more open ended and experimental.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2800</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pig</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851240/extras/d5be249d73c277935f43b0012e67dfd4.poster.avif?t=1755083841\" width=508 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851240/extras/d5be249d73c277935f43b0012e67dfd4.webm?t=1755083841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851240/extras/d5be249d73c277935f43b0012e67dfd4.mp4?t=1755083841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything you saw above takes place inside the pig.\u2800</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the mind of a dissonant Pig and explore its different realms and domains.\u2800</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Divide molecules, command cellular entities, rearrange and light up neurologic pathways, combine harmonic and gurgling sound cells, squish or drench the warbling ligaments,... These are some of the jobs you'll come across in KLOPPYSSIMO to help you understand the inner workings of the ever elusive Pig.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851240/extras/935ad8546d94f0458b68f388c6a9a64f.poster.avif?t=1755083841\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851240/extras/935ad8546d94f0458b68f388c6a9a64f.webm?t=1755083841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851240/extras/935ad8546d94f0458b68f388c6a9a64f.mp4?t=1755083841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "A fusion between puzzle-solving and music creation awaits you! Craft beats, solve playful puzzles, unlock new sounds, explore a strange overworld, and experiment in a freeform sandbox\u2014to heal a pig? Lose yourself in this creative and synesthetic experience!",
